{
	"name": "Grasping Vines",
	"type": "feature",
	"img": "icons/magic/nature/root-vine-entangled-hand.webp",
	"system": {
		"description": "<p>You command the plant-like growths on your limbs to extend your reach. As a bonus action you may summon a length of vine to grapple a foe. Choose a creature within 10 feet of you. That creature must succeed on a Strength saving throw versus your maneuver DC or become [[/condition id=grappled]] by your vine until the end of your next turn. You may use this ability a number of times equal to your proficiency bonus per long rest.</p>",
